WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.599 --> 00:00:05.500
Speaker 1: We've been covering the supposed
bankruptcy of Infowars conspiracy theorist

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.020
Alex Jones.

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:14.150
This is a very complicated topic, which involves
Alex Jones being the target of multiple lawsuits

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:20.040
and presumably going in the direction of him
owing people a bunch of money, including parents

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:22.250
of the victims of Sandy Hook.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:27.140
And interspersed with this, I told you a couple
of weeks ago that Alex Jones has declared

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:32.400
bankruptcy and we and others immediately questioned
the timing of the bankruptcy.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:38.140
And, of course, the useful nature of a bankruptcy
if you're trying to avoid paying anybody.

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:40.679
One of the great things to do is to say you
don't have any money.

00:00:40.679 --> 00:00:47.249
Well, now Alex Jones is actually bragging
about $2 million donations that they received.

00:00:47.249 --> 00:00:51.729
He says now they have $5 million in the bank.

00:00:51.729 --> 00:00:55.920
And this is something that to me, it seems
like it would be very interesting to the bankruptcy

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:56.920
trustees.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:57.920
Take a look.

00:00:57.920 --> 00:00:58.920
Speaker 3: Yes.

00:00:58.920 --> 00:00:59.920
What you must have made the donor mad.

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:00.920
I don't know who they are, where they are.

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:03.089
They could be in Japan, could be in the U.S.,
could be who knows where.

00:01:03.089 --> 00:01:04.909
I appreciate them, whoever they are.

00:01:04.909 --> 00:01:09.610
But hundreds of millions of dollars of Bitcoin
and the lower price back in 2016.

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:12.510
Never spent any of them and is now giving
us.

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:19.210
$1,000,000 in Bitcoin and you must have upset
them, whoever they are, because all part to

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:20.710
the left of the globalist.

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:23.210
They gave us $1,000,000 more on Saturday.

00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:26.740
Only break that for you while you sit there
and say we're covering it all up and hiding

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:28.880
and in bank accounts and all this crap.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:29.880
So.

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:33.110
Speaker 1: I mean, you don't even need a bank
account to hide Bitcoin to.

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:34.110
Actually.

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:38.940
Speaker 3: We no longer have $3 million in
the company, barely enough to make payroll

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:40.540
and operate my product.

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:43.109
We now have $5 million.

00:01:43.109 --> 00:01:44.159
And guess what?

00:01:44.159 --> 00:01:45.159
You must.

00:01:45.159 --> 00:01:49.460
Speaker 1: So I'm sure this is something the
bankruptcy court would be interested in.

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:55.350
Bankruptcy trustees, the trustee overseeing
the Sandy Hook parents case, the Sandy Hook

00:01:55.350 --> 00:01:58.170
families would be at very, very interested
in hearing about this.

00:01:58.170 --> 00:02:03.450
You know, I sat next to one of Alex Jones
former attorneys on a flight recently.

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:06.560
I talked about this on the bonus show or maybe
it was on a livestream.

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:08.850
I don't think I've mentioned it on the podcast.

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:14.320
No attorney client privilege was breached
because it was publicly known that this lawyer

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:17.130
represented Alex Jones at one point.

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:19.310
It was quite a conversation.

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:27.370
And you know, Alex Jones on the one hand has
a whole area of controversy related to what

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:29.570
counts as free speech.

00:02:29.570 --> 00:02:31.520
And that's controversial enough.

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:34.680
And when does the speech become defamatory?

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:37.470
And all of these things are kind of being
legislated right now.

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:42.260
The other side of this is this very strange
and suspicious bankruptcy.

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:50.110
And I don't doubt for a second that the bankruptcy
isn't justifiable in some way, but the timing

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:52.510
is just so suspect.

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:54.180
So suspect.

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:56.540
And now bragging about having $5 million.

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:59.840
Now, if you went to him, he would go for us.

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:06.290
5 million is borderline bankruptcy because
our payroll is so high and our costs to produce

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:07.950
all these various supplements is.

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:13.110
So I don't even know whether the supplements
are actually some people when they do products,

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:15.330
they don't buy a bunch of inventory upfront.

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:17.450
They're just kind of produced and shipped
on demand.

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:22.600
Dropshipping And we don't know the nature
of that business, but he would say this is

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:24.810
just barely enough to fund our operation.

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:26.530
It's not like now we're flush with cash.

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:33.250
We certainly don't have any money for the
Sandy Hook families, but this all stinks to

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:36.330
high heaven and it continues to point in that
direction.

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:38.350
And quite frankly, I don't know what the end
game is.

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:43.340
I don't know if Alex Jones genuinely believes
that these manipulations when it comes to

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:49.160
the bankruptcy and having cash and not in
Bitcoin donations and all of it, I don't know.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:50.160
I don't know.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:58.680
The other thing is whether there's someone
wrote to me and said, Alex Jones seems confused

00:03:58.680 --> 00:04:04.820
about whether they got $1,000,000 in Bitcoin
or whether they got one Bitcoin.

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:08.150
Now, could he really be confused about that?

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:09.150
I don't think so.

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:13.680
Now, if he knows the value, listen, I have
absolutely no idea, but it would be an extra

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:17.269
funny thing on top of all of the scam that's
being run here.

00:04:17.269 --> 00:04:22.870
If he actually got one bitcoin and not $1,000,000
in Bitcoin, one bitcoin worth about 30, 35

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:24.439
grand at this point in time.

00:04:24.439 --> 00:04:28.620
I don't know what the future of this is, but
it all stinks and the grifting and the scamming

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:29.710
continues.

